elling & Marketing Exp |        98.78 |       104.48 |        78.86 |        78.52 |\n| R&D Exp                 |        46.95 |        43.48 |        42.63 |        41.68 |\n| General & Admin Exp     |       151.60 |       149.22 |       100.08 |       133.10 |\n| Operating Income        |        82.01 |        73.50 |       155.46 |       169.51 |\n| Operating Margin (%)    |         3.71 |         3.80 |         7.88 |         8.55 |\n| Net Income              |        50.88 |        70.34 |         2.52 |       163.37 |\n| Net Margin (%)          |         2.30 |         3.63 |         0.13 |         8.24 |\n| Op Cash Flow            |        -3.51 |      -176.84 |       538.86 |      -320.36 |\n| Investing Cash Flow     |       103.32 |      -218.24 |       -30.07 |       -90.79 |\n| Financing Cash Flow     |      -150.18 |       163.62 |       -62.41 |       121.77 |\n| CAPEX                   |         8.34 |       -67.70 |       -63.62 |       -37.59 |"
